                                      rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/cpo#ProductType> ;
                                      rdfs:label "has product type"@en ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an installed product to its type in the catalogue."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/cpo#hasRatedPower
